# GDD Alignment Check

- Before planning or implementing any new feature/mechanic, read `IMPORTANT_GAME_GDD.md`.
- Validate the proposed work against:
  - key game systems,
  - core design goals,
  - intended player journey.
- If the proposal appears misaligned, pause and ask the user to confirm intent before continuing.
- Use concise alignment questions to confirm:
  - why this feature is being added,
  - whether divergence from the GDD is intentional,
  - whether the GDD should be updated to reflect the new direction.
